            "definition": {
              "text": "# Alias Round Trip Runbook\n\nOperational runbook for scheduled worker and batch job monitoring.\n\nExample workload monitoring dashboard.\n\nEmpty worker runs are healthy. Heartbeat monitors are independent of incoming workload volume.",
              "type": "markdown"
            }
          },
          "id": "hta17cko",
          "type": "notebook_cells"
        },
        {
          "attributes": {
            "definition": {
              "text": "## Monitor: workload heartbeat missing\n\n### What this alert means\n\nThe scheduled worker CronJobs are expected to run every five minutes. A missing heartbeat means a job may be unhealthy, independent of incoming workload volume.",
              "type": "markdown"
            }
          },
          "id": "vl84bf52",
          "type": "notebook_cells"
        },
        {
          "attributes": {
